{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find a strange puppet that clings to your arm and won\u2019t let you escape. Now, you must find a way to free yourself while uncovering the secrets it hides and how it's connected to a powerful television channel.\u200b </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate what they don\u2019t want you to know</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and follow the hidden path left behind by Channel 7. Every clue brings you closer to uncovering the truth behind a twisted, abandoned puppet show.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware the environment</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a handcrafted world, full of details that enrich the atmosphere. But remember: the environment is hostile and interactive, and every step could turn against you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Puppet</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no choice but to live alongside a sleeping puppet that will raise more questions than answers. It\u2019s inevitable that you will get to know it, and what you uncover could change everything.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you uncover the truth before it's too late?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275410?t=1773434267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275410/2f61514fc84d143f1273c3315192522025af8376/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773434267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275410/d7d81eb60f3cd457afb0c1fdd82f9223ac08867b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773434267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275410/d7d81eb60f3cd457afb0c1fdd82f9223ac08867b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773434267","categories":[{"description":"S